sections.body:
Available payment methods:
- payment card (Visa, Mastercard) and payment services offered at checkout;
- bank transfer against a prepayment invoice;
- payment by invoice — for approved B2B customers only.

A prepayment invoice must be paid within the term stated on it. The order is processed once payment is received. Card payments are processed by a certified payment service provider; the seller never sees or stores card details.

We only use cookies and browser storage that are necessary for the website to work:
- shopping cart — keeps the products in your cart in your browser;
- authentication — maintains your session in the customer portal;
- delivery country (market) — remembers the selected country for price and VAT calculation (up to 1 year);
- cookie choice — remembers your choice in the cookie notice.

No analytics or marketing cookies are used without your consent. You can delete or block cookies in your browser settings, but the cart and sign-in may then not work.
